// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`policy page rendered content and layout > preserves the privacy page DOM 1`] = `"<div class="px-4 md:px-8 flex justify-center" data-testid="privacy-policy-page"><div class="gap-12 w-full max-w-screen-xl flex flex-col"><div class="border-b border-line pb-12"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><span class="font-mono tracking-widest text-text-dim text-xs font-black tracking-wide-editorial uppercase">COMPLIANCE &amp; PRIVACY</span><h1 class="font-display text-text-main text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">Privacy Policy</h1><span class="mt-4 max-w-prose font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed text-pretty">At BoomTick (boomtick.blog), we are committed to respecting your privacy and protecting your personal data. Below is a comprehensive explanation of how we handle authentication details, data security, and communication.</span></div></div><div class="gap-6 w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-database w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"></path><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Information We Collect</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">When you interact with BoomTick or authenticate using Google OAuth, we collect limited personal information necessary to identify you and manage your session. This includes your full name, email address, and profile picture retrieved during the authentication process.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">How We Use Your Data</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">Data retrieved during authentication is used solely for account authentication, verifying user identity, providing account access, and delivering digital operations, web design, and consultation booking services.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2 w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle><line x1="8.59" x2="15.42" y1="13.51" y2="17.49"></line><line x1="15.41" x2="8.59" y1="6.51" y2="10.49"></line></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Data Sharing &amp; Non-Disclosure</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">We strictly do not sell, trade, rent, or transfer your authentication data or personal details to outside third parties. Information is used strictly within the BoomTick ecosystem to facilitate your requested interactions.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Security Measures</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">We implement industry-standard security practices, including encrypted connections (HTTPS), secure session tokens, and strict access controls to safeguard your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-megaphone w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 6a13 13 0 0 0 8.4-2.8A1 1 0 0 1 21 4v12a1 1 0 0 1-1.6.8A13 13 0 0 0 11 14H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"></path><path d="M6 14a12 12 0 0 0 2.4 7.2 2 2 0 0 0 3.2-2.4A8 8 0 0 1 10 14"></path><path d="M8 6v8"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Advertising</span></div><div class="gap-3 flex flex-col"><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">BoomTick displays ads through Google AdSense. When advertising is active, Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites.</span><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">Ads on BoomTick are non-personalized by default. Personalized ads are served only after you accept the Advertisement category in the cookie banner; rejecting it keeps ads non-personalized. You can change your choice at any time by clearing this site's cookies in your browser, and you can opt out of personalized advertising entirely via <a class="text-accent hover:underline" href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of other vendors' personalized ads at <a class="text-accent hover:underline" href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.</span><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">Third-party vendors, including Google, also use cookies to serve ads based on your visits. See <a class="text-accent hover:underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8 w-full"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Developer &amp; Privacy Contact</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal data, please contact developer support directly at <a class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline font-bold" href="mailto:anders.ariel@gmail.com">anders.ariel@gmail.com</a> or official site support at <a class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline font-bold" href="mailto:ari@boomtick.blog">ari@boomtick.blog</a>.</span></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`policy page rendered content and layout > preserves the returns page DOM 1`] = `"<div class="px-4 md:px-8 flex justify-center" data-testid="return-policy-page"><div class="gap-12 w-full max-w-screen-xl flex flex-col"><div class="border-b border-line pb-12"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><span class="font-mono tracking-widest text-text-dim text-xs font-black tracking-wide-editorial uppercase">STORE POLICIES</span><h1 class="font-display text-text-main text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">Return &amp; Refund Policy</h1><span class="mt-4 max-w-prose font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed text-pretty">Because BoomTick items are custom made to order via Printful, specific policies apply for damaged items, size exchanges, and quality claims.</span></div></div><div class="gap-6 w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Damaged, Defective, or Misprinted Items</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">We offer free replacements or full refunds for any merchandise items that arrive damaged, defective, or misprinted. Claims must be submitted within <span class="text-text-main font-semibold">30 days of product delivery</span>.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">How to Submit a Return or Replacement Claim</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">To start a claim, send an email to <a class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline font-semibold" href="mailto:ari@boomtick.blog">ari@boomtick.blog</a> with your order confirmation details, a brief description of the issue, and clear photographic proof of the defect or damage. We will review and process a replacement immediately.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-alert w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Made-to-Order Custom Policy</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">Each product is produced on-demand specifically when ordered. Consequently, we cannot offer buyer's remorse refunds or returns for general change of mind after production has commenced.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Size &amp; Color Exchanges</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">Because items are custom printed, size or color exchanges require placing a new order. Please consult the product sizing descriptions carefully before ordering. If you are unsure of fit, reach out to support at <a class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline font-semibold" href="mailto:ari@boomtick.blog">ari@boomtick.blog</a> prior to purchasing.</span></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`policy page rendered content and layout > preserves the shipping page DOM 1`] = `"<div class="px-4 md:px-8 flex justify-center" data-testid="shipping-policy-page"><div class="gap-12 w-full max-w-screen-xl flex flex-col"><div class="border-b border-line pb-12"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><span class="font-mono tracking-widest text-text-dim text-xs font-black tracking-wide-editorial uppercase">STORE POLICIES</span><h1 class="font-display text-text-main text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">Shipping &amp; Fulfillment Policy</h1><span class="mt-4 max-w-prose font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed text-pretty">BoomTick merchandise is produced on-demand using Printful. Clear delivery expectations, fulfillment timelines, and shipping calculation details are provided below.</span></div></div><div class="gap-6 w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-truck w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2"></path><path d="M15 18H9"></path><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14"></path><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"></circle></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Made-to-Order Fulfillment Model</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">Every merchandise order is printed and assembled on-demand specifically for you by our fulfillment partner, Printful. Made-to-order production minimizes inventory waste and guarantees fresh quality for every apparel item.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Fulfillment &amp; Transit Timeline</span></div><div class="gap-3 flex flex-col"><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span class="text-text-main font-semibold">Fulfillment / Processing Time:</span> 2–7 business days for custom printing, quality control inspection, and packaging prior to dispatch.</span><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span class="text-text-main font-semibold">Domestic Shipping Transit Time:</span> 4–8 business days for standard ground delivery within the United States.</span><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span class="text-text-main font-semibold">Total Estimated Delivery Window:</span> 6–15 business days from order placement to final delivery.</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calculator w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="14" y2="18"></line><path d="M16 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 10h.01"></path><path d="M8 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 14h.01"></path><path d="M8 14h.01"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M8 18h.01"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Shipping Fee Calculation</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">Shipping fees are variable and calculated dynamically at checkout by Printful based on item category (e.g. t-shirts, crop hoodies, totes, mugs), package weight, and shipping destination. Estimated base rates and available carrier options are displayed clearly prior to order confirmation.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Inquiries &amp; Order Support</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">If you have questions about your order dispatch or tracking status, please email official support at <a class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline font-semibold" href="mailto:ari@boomtick.blog">ari@boomtick.blog</a>. Include your order ID and full name for swift tracking assistance.</span></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`policy page rendered content and layout > preserves the terms page DOM 1`] = `"<div class="px-4 md:px-8 flex justify-center" data-testid="terms-of-service-page"><div class="gap-12 w-full max-w-screen-xl flex flex-col"><div class="border-b border-line pb-12"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><span class="font-mono tracking-widest text-text-dim text-xs font-black tracking-wide-editorial uppercase">COMPLIANCE &amp; LEGAL</span><h1 class="font-display text-text-main text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">Terms of Service</h1><span class="mt-4 max-w-prose font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed text-pretty">Welcome to BoomTick (boomtick.blog). Please read these Terms of Service carefully before accessing our application, digital products, or consulting services.</span></div></div><div class="gap-6 w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Acceptance of Terms</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">By accessing, browsing, authenticating, or using boomtick.blog, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-briefcase w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Description of Service</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">BoomTick provides web design, business automation, custom dance merchandise, and digital operations consulting services for independent creatives and studios.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user-check w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16 11 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">User Responsibilities</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">Users agree to utilize the platform for lawful purposes only and refrain from any unauthorized automated access, tampering with authentication procedures, or engaging in conduct that impairs system stability or security.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Intellectual Property</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">All software code, branding, logos, graphics, design assets, and written content hosted on boomtick.blog are the exclusive property of BoomTick and Ariel Anders, protected under applicable copyright and trademark laws.</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8 w-full"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16"></line></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Limitation of Liability</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">BoomTick and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from service interruptions, temporary unavailability, or third-party service provider outages. Services are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis.</span></div></div><div class="bg-card-bg rounded-md border border-line p-6 md:p-8 w-full"><div class="gap-4 flex flex-col"><div class="gap-3 flex flex-row items-center"><div class="rounded-md p-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg></div><span class="font-display text-text-main text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">Contact &amp; Legal Inquiries</span></div><span class="font-sans break-words text-text-dim text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty">For any questions regarding these Terms of Service, please reach out to developer support at <a class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline font-bold" href="mailto:anders.ariel@gmail.com">anders.ariel@gmail.com</a> or official site support at <a class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline font-bold" href="mailto:ari@boomtick.blog">ari@boomtick.blog</a>.</span></div></div></div></div>"`;
